From 08337016fb50fec5826b246175e14c1151749ceb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Javier Maestro <jjmaestro@ieee.org>
Date: Fri, 3 Apr 2026 07:07:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/14] =?UTF-8?q?docs:=20fix=20SOURCES=20=E2=86=92=20VERSI?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ONS=20in=20repo.bzl=20doc?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The DOC string said SOURCES but the generated repo.bzl constant is
VERSIONS.
---
 docs/download/archives/repository.md | 2 +-
 download/archives/repository.bzl     | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/download/archives/repository.md b/docs/download/archives/repository.md
index 4ce50ee..7bfc128 100644
--- a/docs/download/archives/repository.md
+++ b/docs/download/archives/repository.md
@@ -94,7 +94,7 @@ The root package also has the following:
 - `//:metadata.json`: the repo metadata.
 - `//:repo.bzl`: extension with the following constants:
   - `REPO_NAME`: The short repo name.
-  - `SOURCES`: a mapping of the downloaded `version`s to the `source` from
+  - `VERSIONS`: a mapping of the downloaded `version`s to the `source` from
     which the archive was downloaded.
   - `DEFAULT_VERSION`: the default `version` of the archive.
   - `LOCK`: a `dict` with the contents of the repo `lock.json`.
diff --git a/download/archives/repository.bzl b/download/archives/repository.bzl
index 48212ce..e83fea5 100644
--- a/download/archives/repository.bzl
+++ b/download/archives/repository.bzl
@@ -88,7 +88,7 @@ The root package also has the following:
 - `//:metadata.json`: the repo metadata.
 - `//:repo.bzl`: extension with the following constants:
   - `REPO_NAME`: The short repo name.
-  - `SOURCES`: a mapping of the downloaded `version`s to the `source` from
+  - `VERSIONS`: a mapping of the downloaded `version`s to the `source` from
     which the archive was downloaded.
   - `DEFAULT_VERSION`: the default `version` of the archive.
   - `LOCK`: a `dict` with the contents of the repo `lock.json`.
